# Extra packages to remove, beyond Omarchy's preinstalls (which the remove
# module handles through `omarchy-remove-preinstalls`). One per line.
#
# Uncomment to trim further. Check `pacman -Qi <pkg>` "Required By" first;
# omarchy-pkg-drop uses `pacman -Rns`, which refuses to break dependencies.

# omarchy-nvim     # Omarchy's Neovim setup (you use Emacs)
# foot             # previous default terminal, once ghostty is default
# chromium         # once firefox is default browser
